  "id": "community-centered-approach",
  "term": "community-centered approach",
  "definition": "A community-centered approach is a way of developing research or other work by involving the people most affected as equal partners from the start. It emphasizes lived experience, mutual learning, respect, and sustained engagement so community members can help identify priorities and shape the agenda.",
